  id: route-haven
  title: Haven return mail
  kind: 2
  cost: 2
  hint: Send two coins at the Haven sorting box. E there reroutes the same loan.
    Claim it at the addressed LOW or HIGH box before paying the main bell.
  journalText: Ada never trusted a single return route. The sorter held the same
    two coins for either road; no one had to pay twice to change their mind.
  prerequisite: lamp-haven
